s4-2-p9 : Block
s4-2-p9 = prose (cons "The adjacency relation, the positions, a selected node, and a proof of a graph property can all be bundled into one dependent structure. In a graph groupoid or a suitable univalent structured-graph type, a path representing relabeling acts on that bundle; a bare permutation of node indices does not by itself identify arbitrary indexed data. A user interface showing the graph and a graph algorithm computing a path are then different interpretations of the same object, with relabeling invariance expressed once." nil)
